      "title": "Radius Hierarchy",
      "content": "The radius system is strictly tiered: 2px for small inline elements, 15px for nav and small links, 25px for buttons, 30px for badges and inline cards, and 40px for major feature cards. Every radius value in the system belongs to this ladder — no custom intermediate values. This consistency is what gives the interface its toy-like, soft-edged feel."
